      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "남다른 포켓몬들과\n승부해 주실 건가요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕő",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B0A8B2E4B9780020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4ACFC000AC2B9BD80D5740020C8FCC2E40020AC74AC00C694003F00100002011401510000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승부하자!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9BD80D558C79000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럴 기분이 아니야",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7F40020AE30BD84C7740020C544B2C8C57C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "말은 그렇게 하시지만\n실은 남다른 포켓몬들이 보고 싶어서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n온몸이 근질근질한 거 아니에요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕő",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9D0C7400020ADF8B807AC8C0020D558C2DCC9C0B9CC000AC2E4C7400020B0A8B2E4B9780020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7740020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C5B4C11C00100001BE00000AC628BAB8C7740020ADFCC9C8ADFCC9C8D55C0020AC700020C544B2C8C5D0C694003F00100002011401510000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "미르에선 볼 수 없는\n희귀한 포켓몬들의 매력을 보여 드리겠어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕő",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBF8B974C5D0C1200020BCFC0020C2180020C5C6B294000AD76CADC0D55C0020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7580020B9E4B825C7440020BCF4C5EC0020B4DCB9ACACA0C5B4C694002100100002011401510000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "작년에 바캉스로 다녀온 가라르지방에서만\n볼 수 있는 포켓몬들은 정말 매력적이었어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕő",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C791B144C5D00020BC14CE89C2A4B85C0020B2E4B140C6280020AC00B77CB974C9C0BC29C5D0C11CB9CC000ABCFC0020C2180020C788B2940020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C7400020C815B9D00020B9E4B825C801C774C5C8C5B4C694002100100002011401510000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그중에서도 갑옷섬에만 있다는 야돈은,\n주식인 가라두구의 영향으로 자극적인<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n향기가 나더라구요! 진짜 신기하죠?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕő",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8C911C5D0C11CB3C40020AC11C637C12CC5D0B9CC0020C788B2E4B2940020C57CB3C8C740002C000AC8FCC2DDC7780020AC00B77CB450AD6CC7580020C601D5A5C73CB85C0020C790ADF9C801C77800100001BE00000AD5A5AE30AC000020B098B354B77CAD6CC69400210020C9C4C9DC0020C2E0AE30D558C8E0003F00100002011401510000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가라두구나무의 가지로 만든 액세서리를\n야돈에게 주면 진화하는 것도 신기해요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕő",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00B77CB450AD6CB098BB34C7580020AC00C9C0B85C0020B9CCB4E00020C561C138C11CB9ACB97C000AC57CB3C8C5D0AC8C0020C8FCBA740020C9C4D654D558B2940020AC83B3C40020C2E0AE30D574C694002100100002011401510000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 포켓몬들은\n갑옷섬에서 발견되는 가지를 잔뜩 모아서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n야돈에서 진화시킨 아이들이에요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕő",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C740000AAC11C637C12CC5D0C11C0020BC1CACACB418B2940020AC00C9C0B97C0020C794B7290020BAA8C544C11C00100001BE00000AC57CB3C8C5D0C11C0020C9C4D654C2DCD0A80020C544C774B4E4C774C5D0C694002E00100002011401510000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가라르지방에서만 볼 수 있는 포켓몬들의\n힘을 제대로 보여 드리진 못했지만,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n파트너들과 만난 건 인생 최고의 일이었어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕő",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
